6. DATA QUALITY DISCLAIMER
================================================================

The cost data is compiled from public and official sources and
normalised for cross-language and cross-regional comparability.
It is NOT a substitute for formal bids, quotations, or
country-specific professional cost publications and indices.
Licensor makes no representation that prices are current,
complete, or accurate for any specific project. Use at Your own
risk, see Sections 5 and 6 of the CC BY-NC 4.0 legal code for the
full warranty disclaimer.

